<title>USA: Vermont Senate to debate restructuring power cos.</title>
<headline>Vermont Senate to debate restructuring power cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, March 31 (Reuter) The Vermont Senate will debate the pros and cons of restructuring the electric power industry this week.</p>
<p>The bill to be discussed would introduce competition and massively scale back state control of the power companies as regulated monopolies.</p>
<p>Supporters say the move will mean cheaper power and help Vermont utilities compete as other states pass similar measures.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
